<title>UK: Lehman leads $150 mln FRN for First Maryland.</title>
<headline>Lehman leads $150 mln FRN for First Maryland.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FIRST MARYLAND CAPITAL ONE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  FIRST MARYLAND BANCORP</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.JAN.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +100 BP   PAY DATE   15.JAN.97P</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  98.075    FULL FEES   0.875</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB+	REOFFER    98.075</p>
<p> NOTES	P-PLUS 16 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST, LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		CALLABLE FROM YEAR 10 AT PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NY	  HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   =</p>
</text>
